{"name":"Tiny Bubbles","hex":"#0088ab","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tiny","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Very small."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small child; an infant.","Anything very small."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tiny"},{"term":"bubbles","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of bubble"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Sparkling wine; champagne."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bubbles"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tiny Bubbles","blocks":[{"text":"\"Tiny Bubbles\" is a song written by Leon Pober and performed by Don Ho. It comes from the album of the same name. The single peaked at #57 on the Billboard Hot 100 and #14 on the Easy Listening charts in March 1967. By 1968, \"Tiny Bubbles\" was covered about 34 times. It was considered to be Ho's signature song."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2d/TinyBubbles.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiny_Bubbles"},{"title":"Tiny Bubbles (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Tiny Bubbles is an album by Hawaiian singer Don Ho. Released on November 11, 1966, the album peaked at #15 on the Billboard 200 chart due to the success of the single, the title track."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4a/TinyBubblesAlbum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiny_Bubbles_(album)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"tiny":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/En-us-tiny.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/En-us-tiny.ogg/En-us-tiny.ogg.mp3"}],"bubbles":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/En-au-bubbles.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e2/En-au-bubbles.ogg/En-au-bubbles.ogg.mp3"}]}}}